  "question": {
    "text": "<p>In the given figure the total charge stored in the combination of capacitors is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>100</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#181;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>. The value of &lsquo;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>&rsquo; is ______________.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/6d9a3daf-2a9e-4656-ac4d-d98923637a06.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 290px;\" /></p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "5",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>All the capacitors are in parallel combination and therefore potential drop across each capacitor would be the same.</p><p>Charge on the capacitor can be written as,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>V</mi></math>.</p><p>The charge on&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#956;C</mi></math></p><p>The charge on&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#956;C</mi></math></p><p>The charge on&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#956;C</mi></math></p><p>By the given data.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#956;C</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>10</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
    "image": null
  },
